NAME: Month close
OWNER: Revenue Analyst
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: The 1st of every month at 8:37 AM
MILESTONE: 2
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Dan says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/spike-team/context/routines-on.md. If "Month close" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", write "Month close: not switched on" to this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/ and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Dan only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/spike-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md is missing, write NO_CLIENT_SOURCE to the log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, write "no change" and stop.

For last month, compute each offer's payout with offer-payout-math (percent part plus base), list each offer's status (paid, invoiced or projected) from /workspace/spike-team/context/offer-status.md, and list what Dan should invoice and to whom. Send it to Dan only, ask him to confirm each status, and save it to /workspace/spike-team/vault/Money/Income/<YYYY-MM>.md. Change a status only after Dan says so.
